cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "實價收益 — the visible range of Taiwan's rental yield"
abstract: >-
  A rental yield requires a sale price and a rent for the same dwelling.
  Taiwan's public transaction registry (實價登錄) records both, but only 6.25%
  of buildings with a recorded sale also carry a matchable lease. This work
  pairs real sales with real leases in the same building, publishes the yield,
  and quantifies how little of the market that yield describes — then bounds
  the unobserved remainder rather than assuming it resembles what is seen.
type: software
